 "sentences": [
  "Black American Sign Language is a distinct dialect.",
  "It emerged due to segregated schools for the deaf.",
  "Black students attended separate schools from White students.",
  "This created two separate language communities.",
  "BASL uses a larger signing space than standard ASL.",
  "Signers often prefer two-handed signs over one-handed versions.",
  "Even today, this unique dialect persists in the South."
